    {
      "@id": "incdb:ActivityPaperPageAndLeanProofs",
      "@type": "prov:Activity",
      "rdfs:label": "Paper Page and Lean Proofs Implementation",
      "rdfs:comment": "Incidence-only Foundationの学術論文ページとLean 4による形式的証明の実装",
      "prov:startedAtTime": {
        "@type": "xsd:dateTime",
        "@value": "2025-12-06T07:50:00Z"
      },
      "prov:endedAtTime": {
        "@type": "xsd:dateTime",
        "@value": "2025-12-06T08:30:00Z"
      },
      "incdb:changes": [
        "Lean 4証明ファイル（proofs/incidence_foundation.lean）を作成し、AF0-AF5の公理と主要定理の証明スケッチを実装",
        "Lean証明実行スクリプト（scripts/run_lean_proofs.sh）を作成し、検証結果をproofs/results.mdに保存",
        "論文コンテンツ（incdb-web/src/lib/paper/content.ts）を学術論文形式で作成（Abstract, Introduction, Related Work, Methodology, Results, Conclusion, References）",
        "Paperページ（incdb-web/src/routes/paper/+page.svelte）を実装し、論文全文とLean証明結果を表示",
        "ナビゲーション（+layout.svelte）にPaperページを追加",
        "論文ページのスタイリング（印刷対応、セクションナビゲーション、コードブロック表示）を実装"
      ],
      "incdb:deliverables": [
        "proofs/incidence_foundation.lean",
        "proofs/results.md",
        "scripts/run_lean_proofs.sh",
        "incdb-web/src/lib/paper/content.ts",
        "incdb-web/src/routes/paper/+page.svelte",
        "incdb-web/static/proofs/results.md"
      ],
      "incdb:status": "completed"
    },
    {
      "@id": "incdb:ActivityEventSourcingArchitecture",
      "@type": "prov:Activity",
      "rdfs:label": "Event Sourcing Architecture Implementation",
      "rdfs:comment": "イベントソーシングアーキテクチャの実装（1000億〜10兆レコード規模対応）",
      "prov:startedAtTime": {
        "@type": "xsd:dateTime",
        "@value": "2025-12-19T10:00:00Z"
      },
      "prov:endedAtTime": {
        "@type": "xsd:dateTime",
        "@value": "2025-12-19T12:00:00Z"
      },
      "incdb:changes": [
        "Eventモデル（incdb-core/src/model/event.rs）を実装：Event構造体、EventType enum、Incidenceとの相互変換",
        "イベントストリーム（incdb-storage/src/event/event_stream.rs）を実装：時系列順保存・取得、エンティティインデックス",
        "時系列圧縮（incdb-storage/src/compression/）を実装：Delta Encoding、Product Quantization、重複排除",
        "スナップショットストア（incdb-storage/src/event/snapshot_store.rs）を実装：圧縮イベントの保存・読み込み",
        "エンティティ状態ストア（incdb-storage/src/event/entity_state_store.rs）を実装：イベントからの状態更新",
        "EventSourcedGraph（incdb-core/src/model/event_sourced_graph.rs）を実装：WorldGraph互換API、イベントリプレイ",
        "EventSourcedGraphBuilder（incdb-core/src/model/event_sourced_graph_builder.rs）を実装：簡単な初期化",
        "GraphWrapper（incdb-core/src/model/graph_wrapper.rs）を実装：EventSourcedGraphとWorldGraphの統一インターフェース"
      ],
      "incdb:deliverables": [
        "incdb-core/src/model/event.rs",
        "incdb-core/src/model/event_sourced_graph.rs",
        "incdb-core/src/model/event_sourced_graph_builder.rs",
        "incdb-core/src/model/graph_wrapper.rs",
        "incdb-storage/src/event/event_stream.rs",
        "incdb-storage/src/event/snapshot_store.rs",
        "incdb-storage/src/event/entity_state_store.rs",
        "incdb-storage/src/compression/temporal_compression.rs",
        "incdb-storage/src/compression/product_quantization.rs"
      ],
      "incdb:status": "completed"
    },
    {
      "@id": "incdb:ActivityHNSWIntegration",
