      "@id": "incdb:ActivityCircularDependencyResolution",
      "@type": "prov:Activity",
      "rdfs:label": "Circular Dependency Resolution",
      "rdfs:comment": "incdb-coreとincdb-storageの循環依存を解決し、EventSourcedGraphのSendトレイトエラーを修正",
      "prov:startedAtTime": {
        "@type": "xsd:dateTime",
        "@value": "2025-12-19T14:30:00Z"
      },
      "prov:endedAtTime": {
        "@type": "xsd:dateTime",
        "@value": "2025-12-19T15:00:00Z"
      },
      "incdb:changes": [
        "EventSourcedGraphとEventSourcedGraphBuilderをincdb-storageに移動",
        "GraphWrapperをincdb-storageに移動",
        "incdb-coreからincdb-storage依存を削除（循環依存解決）",
        "EventSourcedGraph内のstd::sync::Mutexをtokio::sync::Mutexに置き換え",
        "すべての.lock().unwrap()を.lock().awaitに変更",
        "EventSourcedGraphBuilderのMutex作成をtokio::sync::Mutexに変更",
        "incdb-apiのGraphQLスキーマでtokio::sync::Mutexを使用",
        "incdb-cliのQuery/ExportコマンドをGraphWrapper対応に修正"
      ],
      "incdb:deliverables": [
        "incdb-storage/src/graph/event_sourced_graph.rs",
        "incdb-storage/src/graph/event_sourced_graph_builder.rs",
        "incdb-storage/src/graph/graph_wrapper.rs",
        "incdb-storage/src/graph/mod.rs",
        "incdb-core/Cargo.toml (incdb-storage依存削除)",
        "incdb-api/src/graphql/event_sourced_schema.rs (tokio::sync::Mutex使用)",
        "incdb-cli/src/main.rs (GraphWrapper対応)"
      ],
      "incdb:status": "completed"
    }
